                        "entry_id": "8e449ab9-a465-3491-abc5-82c2fde3e0a8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The capital city of Libya, originally three separate settlements known as Oea, Sabratha, and Leptis Magna."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "849cd2ac-46fa-40f3-9435-a67ab19213ec",
                                "sense_id": "57e2883a-3a56-3095-afc7-2f8290e97aa5",
                                "text": "When he got to Zawiyah, the coastal town west of Tripoli that has become the main hub for the people-smuggling industry, he was kidnapped a second time and held in a tiny cell for six months."
                            }
                        ]
